===Etymology===
From {{etyl|tr}} {{term|şiş|lang=tr}} {{term|kebap|lang=tr}}, ''şiş kebabı''. <ref>[http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/shish%20kebab "shish kebab."] Merriam-Webster Online Dictionary. 2008.</ref>

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[shish]] [[kebab]]}}

# Small [[cube]]s of any kind of [[meat]], [[fowl]] or [[fish]] with or without [[vegetables]] that are [[skewered]] on a wooden or metal [[stick]] and roasted in an oven or over an open fire.

